<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    DESIGN SIZE OF THE FADER GROUP ON WIDE PANELS (1000dp and up).

    The group - the car with its arrows and numbers - is laid out at this size and then scaled whole
    by ScaleToFitLayout. The base value in values/dimens.xml is the narrow case (400dp), because half
    of a 600dp Tesla panel is 300dp and a 640dp group there had to shrink to 0.47: arrows 17dp,
    numbers about 8sp, measured on the unit 12.09.2026.

    Here there is room for the full drawing, and the reference 1280x720 keeps exactly the geometry it
    has always had. Width only: the height stays 648dp everywhere, and what does not fit vertically
    scrolls, which is the rule the bass card on the left half of that tab already follows.
-->
<resources>
    <dimen name="fader_group_width">640dp</dimen>
</resources>
